### Books - Book club reading endpoints
### Rode cada request clicando no ▶ ao lado de "###" (Android Studio / IntelliJ).
### Pré-requisitos: ter um book club (book-clubs.http) e um book (books.http).

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Listar todas as leituras
GET {{host}}/api/book-club-readings
Accept: application/json

### Buscar leitura por id
GET {{host}}/api/book-club-readings/1
Accept: application/json

### Criar leitura (201)
POST {{host}}/api/book-club-readings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookClubId": 1,
  "bookId": 1,
  "startDate": "2026-07-01",
  "endDate": "2026-07-31",
  "meetLink": "https://meet.example.com/sci-fi-julho"
}

### Mesmo clube lendo OUTRO livro em OUTRO período (201)
POST {{host}}/api/book-club-readings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookClubId": 1,
  "bookId": 2,
  "startDate": "2026-08-01",
  "endDate": "2026-08-31"
}

### Conflito: mesmo clube + mesmo range de datas (409)
### -> "you'r book club is already reading a book for these dates"
POST {{host}}/api/book-club-readings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookClubId": 1,
  "bookId": 2,
  "startDate": "2026-07-01",
  "endDate": "2026-07-31"
}

### Editar leitura (200)
PUT {{host}}/api/book-club-readings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookClubId": 1,
  "bookId": 1,
  "startDate": "2026-07-01",
  "endDate": "2026-07-15",
  "meetLink": "https://meet.example.com/atualizado"
}

### Criar com book club inexistente (404)
POST {{host}}/api/book-club-readings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookClubId": 9999,
  "bookId": 1,
  "startDate": "2026-09-01",
  "endDate": "2026-09-30"
}

### Criar inválido (400 — campos obrigatórios ausentes)
POST {{host}}/api/book-club-readings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "meetLink": "https://meet.example.com/x"
}

### Deletar leitura (204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/book-club-readings/1
